<reference id="saml-StationServiceProviderFolder" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">Station Service Provider Folder (saml-StationServiceProviderFolder)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Located under the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">CircleOfTrust</uicontrol> component,
this is a container for the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">StationServiceProvider</uicontrol> component.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">saml-StationServiceProviderFolder</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">Component location:  <apiname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/apiname ">saml</apiname> palette. It has no unique properties of its own.</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">To access this
